{"title":"","link":"https://bradbarrish.com/2026/09/28/good-lord-this-low-performance.html","date":1790638447000,"content":"<p>Good lord. This Low performance of “When I Go Deaf” from 2013 absolutely wrecked me. I miss them as a band and still can’t believe <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/music/article/2024/jul/19/lows-alan-sparhawk-on-the-death-of-his-wife-and-bandmate-mimi-parker-if-you-fall-in-love-you-know-this-could-happen\">Mimi is gone</a>. Low is just one of those bands for me… (h/t <a href=\"https://sippey.com/2026/09/28/low-when-i-go-deaf.html\">Sippy</a>)</p>\n","author":"","siteTitle":"Brad Barrish","siteHash":"91e49f51884b2947fac16e947ba7e59fe5a24800befb4760d388da1b057f4f23","entryHash":"72dd3b6163a4618b982f81c5acaddbc6ecd85193862636dd867d4fb0f470e4a2","category":"Sites"}